CPU SNAP periodic-image regression case.

This uses the same potential and two-atom separation as 102_SNAP_base,
but places the atoms on opposite sides of the periodic boundary. Their
energy, force magnitude, and stress must match the unwrapped case. The
periodic neighbor contributes through the MDCell ghost-force return path.

Model files: ../../SIMULATION_MODELS/snap_103_pbc.coeff and
../../SIMULATION_MODELS/snap_103_pbc.param.
